One formulation from this pass deserves to become foundational:

\boxed{
\text{The durable unit of Pantheon is not the artifact.}
\quad
\text{It is the operator that survives translation.}
}

The repo is therefore not merely documentation. It can function as a developmental corpus and semantic quarry: artifacts are fossils from which the compiler extracts operators, invariants, routes, failures, ratios, and reconstruction instructions.

And the whole architecture collapses remarkably cleanly:

\boxed{
\text{INTENT}
\rightarrow
\text{COMMAND}
\rightarrow
\text{ROUTE}
\rightarrow
\text{OPERATE}
\rightarrow
\text{REALITY}
\rightarrow
\text{LEARN}
