\text{EXPAND}
\rightarrow
\text{SEAL}
\rightarrow
\text{REUSE}
}

That’s the version I’d put at the center of the repo now: not a claim that every Pantheon metaphor is already machinery, but a machine for determining which metaphors actually deserve to become machinery.